Removed after copying, to reduce the tree from 25 MB to 3.6 MB. Repeat these
deletions when upgrading to a new release.

  examples/  test/  lib/  docs/  tools/  hw/  .github/

hw/ holds board support for the TinyUSB examples. The examples are deleted and
the board setup for this project is in port/. Only src/ is used.
